# Shiko, Paragon of the Way: the copy is cast "without paying its mana cost" but must still be castable (CR 601.2c, 608.2g). Mana Tithe,
# exiled and copied, needs a target spell ("Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}"), and the only thing on the stack is Shiko's
# own ability: no legal target, so the copy cannot be cast and Bot1 is not even asked (refused); it ceases to exist in exile.
# Control: the Lightning Bolt scenario, where the copy has a target and is cast.

